      "Speaker": "Alex Moreno",
      "Meeting": "Buyer tour and terms",
      "Transcript (what the broker says)": "Debrief, Northpoint Logistics Center, 2650 Northpoint Boulevard in Haslet. Just finished the tour with Priya Raman from Halvorsen Industrial Partners. Good meeting. They're in at twenty nine point seven million, which is a five and a half percent cap on in-place NOI. Earnest money is five hundred, no, sorry, seven hundred fifty thousand, going hard at the end of a forty five day due diligence period. Closing is thirty days after diligence ends. All cash, no financing contingency. Priya wants the PSA executed by this Friday, November sixth, and diligence starts that day. Next steps: Marco Delgado at Lakeview Title needs to open escrow and send wiring instructions to Priya's team. Owen Pratt should turn the PSA draft by Wednesday the fourth. Jenna, please send Priya the rent roll and the T-12 today, and update the BOV comps with this trade. Priya also asked about the Lone Star Home Goods lease, it rolls at the end of 2028, so let's get her the renewal history.",
      "Words": 165,
