    },
    {
      "Debrief ID": "B2",
      "Deal ID": "D2",
      "Date": "2026-11-03",
      "Weekday": "Tuesday",
      "Speaker": "Alex Moreno",
      "Meeting": "LOI meeting, buyer and seller",
      "Transcript (what the broker says)": "Debrief on Cedar Row Office, 1800 Cedar Row Drive, Dallas. Met with Henry Lam from Stonebridge Capital and our seller, Natalie Brooks from Cedar Row Partners. We signed the LOI at eighteen and a half, sorry, eighteen and a quarter million. Four hundred thousand dollars earnest money, thirty day due diligence. Henry is financing with Riverbend Commercial Bank, Dana Whitfield is his lender, about sixty percent loan to value at six point four percent fixed for five years. Henry's big concern is Summit Ridge Engineering, their lease expires at the end of December, so Jenna, please confirm their renewal status with the property manager by Friday. Owen Pratt will draft the PSA, target is Wednesday the eleventh. Ravi, set up Henry's second tour for next week. I'll send Henry a recap of the LOI terms today.",
      "Words": 136,
      "Traps it tests": "Self-correction ($18.5M \u2192 $18.25M); closing never mentioned; cap rate never stated; lender named but no email requested"
    },
    {
      "Debrief ID": "B3",
      "Deal ID": "D3",
      "Date": "2026-11-04",
      "Weekday": "Wednesday",
      "Speaker": "Alex Moreno",
      "Meeting": "Listing pitch",
      "Transcript (what the broker says)": "Debrief, Trinity Commons Apartments, 4100 Trinity Commons Parkway, Fort Worth. Listing pitch with Graham Whitley of Whitley Family Holdings. Two hundred twenty units, about ninety four percent occupied. Graham thinks it's worth forty one to forty two million. Our early read on the T-12 is closer to forty and a half, so we need the BOV to back up the number before we talk price again. His nephew Daniel handles the books and will send the last three months of rent rolls. Jenna, finish the BOV by Friday the thirteenth. Ravi, schedule a unit walk for the twelfth. I'll send Graham our engagement proposal by Monday the ninth. No deal terms yet, this is a pitch.",
