    },
    {
      "Debrief ID": "B4",
      "Deal ID": "D1",
      "Date": "2026-11-20",
      "Weekday": "Friday",
      "Speaker": "Alex Moreno",
      "Meeting": "Retrade call",
      "Transcript (what the broker says)": "Quick update on Northpoint Logistics. Priya called, their roof inspection came back and the roof on the east side needs replacement, about four hundred eighty thousand. They asked for a price cut to twenty nine point two two million and fifteen more days of diligence. I talked to Carla Benavides at Northpoint Holdings and we landed at twenty nine point three million with a ten day extension. Deposit stays at seven fifty. Owen needs to draft the first amendment to the PSA by Monday the twenty third. Jenna, rerun the cap rate on the new price and update the BOV file. I'll let Marco know the dates moved.",
